{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "24e91e4c-c314-8941-b3b3-b98e91a79738",
  "created_at": "2026-01-22T10:07:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maureen Cullen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:04:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:04:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good morning. I am calling for the Registry of Motor Vehicles. I need to renew my license. This is the Registry?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:04:26-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, no, I'm sorry. This is the City Clerk's office, City of Newport. The Registry is a state office, so it's a different number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:04:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. City of Newport. I see. I looked up the number on my phone and I dial it, I think it is right. Maybe I dial wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:04:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That can happen. Do you remember what area code you dialed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:04:52-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I dialed four-zero-one. Is that not the state? I thought four-zero-one is all of Rhode Island, so the state, it is the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:05:02-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're right, four-zero-one covers the whole state. So the area code was fine. It's the rest of the number that would be different. The state offices and the city offices all share that area code."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:05:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. So the area code is the same but the other numbers, they are not. I understand. A little."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:05:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Same area code, different seven digits. Do you have the number you were trying to call in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:05:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not in front of me, no. I was reading it from the little box on the search, on the phone. Maybe I touched the wrong one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:05:45-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's easy to do on a small screen. What I'd suggest is searching for the Rhode Island Registry of Motor Vehicles, and make sure the result says it's the state government site. The number will be listed on that page."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:06:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rhode Island Registry of Motor Vehicles. State government. Okay, I write it down. Is there a different one for Newport? A branch?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:06:10-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the branch details here, I'm sorry. The state website would tell you which locations are open and whether you can renew without going in. They would know better than I would."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:06:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that is fine. I will look on the website. Thank you for being patient with me. Your name is Owen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:06:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Owen, yes. No trouble at all. Sorry we couldn't take care of it for you here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:06:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, it is okay. Not your fault. It is a good day to be indoors, anyway. So I will stay inside and call again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:06:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a good plan. It's pretty raw out there this morning. Take care now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:06:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. You too. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:07:00-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
